Z||000003||mrfiero||06-15-2001||08:28 PM||||That is the inherent flaw with the aftermarket slaves.  The cast iron construction makes it prone to breaking......they are also nearly impossible to bleed correctly.<P>I would try your local dealer for the original slave.  Just because gmpartsdirect.com says they're not available doesn't mean they are discontinued.  If they have to order a part they say it's not available.<P>Putting on another aftermarket slave will just prolong your agony.....do whatever you can to loacte an original GM slave!   ||||reg||1
