Z||000005||fiero56||06-15-2001||11:17 PM||||Aftermarket slaves are crap. I had the same problem with a Raybestos cast-iron unit. But, my second cast-iron Raybestos slave I think now has 20K+ miles on it with no problems yet. Just stay away from using ATF in the clutch system, heed my warning! That $hit fu##s everything up.||||reg||1
